  "_note": [
    "The Colonisation tree — the store COLONISATION_TREE.md transcribes. The schema is TREES.md § The store — `*_tree.json`, and tree_lint.js cross-checks doc and store both ways.",
    "No actor, so no scorer: there is no pursued_when and no scorer_terms. A culture acquires a node by time on ground that satisfies its gate, or by contact; a daughter copies its parent's mask at coining.",
    "Ids are CO-<branch>-<ring><seq>; 'm' is the one milestone per ring, on the spire. Each edge is listed once, on the node farther from the root; the root CO-SP-1a lists none, and that empty list is how the generated table derives is_root (tree_lint holds exactly one).",
    "A milestone's requires names the spire major at its ring (AND); requires_any names the four branch majors at its ring, ANY TWO of which satisfy it (TREES.md § Milestones, and how a tree unlocks the next; COLONISATION_TREE.md § Milestones).",
    "Magnitudes are placeholders by judgement — per_mille 20–80 on minors, 60–200 on majors — and the sweep re-prices them.",
    "Names are generic mechanism nouns; earth_ref is calibration prose and never a place or a people."
  ],
